@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:assumption] lilly-protected-public-infrastructure
The operator MUST include reachable public control-plane and host infrastructure
networks in protected_cidrs before enabling guest networking. Private-range denial alone
does not identify every deployment's public infrastructure (ADR-0015).

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] lilly-network-policy-validated-inputs
Callers MUST construct policy inputs through Network.Config.new/4,5,6,7 and
Network.Guest.new/3 before interpolating interface names, addresses, table names or
CIDRs into nftables programs. Peer strings must not bypass these validators.
